{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37977","headline":"锡宴日作 · 韩偓","name":"锡宴日作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉衔花马蹋香街，诏遣追欢绮席开。\n中使押从天上去外人知自日边来。\n臣心净比漪涟水，圣泽深於潋灩杯。\n才有异恩颁稷契，已将优礼及邹枚。\n清商适向棃园降，妙妓新行峡雨回。\n不敢通宵离禁直，晚乘残醉入银台。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩偓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37977.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37977","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}